cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "PyDRAMsim3 — Python bindings for the DRAMsim3 memory simulator"
abstract: >-
  A high-performance Python binding for DRAMsim3 (cycle-accurate DRAM
  modeling) with a gem5-aligned MemoryController, a C++ SimEngine hot loop
  with bulk event export, and zero-copy numpy trace driving.  Designed for
  CPU/GPU/accelerator architecture simulation.
